<title>USA: U.S. firm to bid on Canada's Altamira fund - WSJ.</title>
<headline>U.S. firm to bid on Canada's Altamira fund - WSJ.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boston venture capital firm TA Associates Inc will make a $583 million bid for Canadian mutual fund company Altamira Management Ltd, the Wall Street Journal reported on Thursday.</p>
<p>The newspaper said the bid was higher than a rival one made by Manufacturers Life Insurance Co for C$660 million.</p>
<p>Altamira shareholders are divided over the sale of the fund.</p>
</text>
